The MIT license above covers the team's original work: source code, texts and
the original drawings in hackatoon-ts/public/assets/ (heart, astronaut,
battery, oxygen tank and solar panels).

Third-party materials (not covered by the MIT license above):

- Plant and pot sprites in hackatoon-ts/public/assets/granja/:
  "FREE Pixel Art Flower Pack" by Karsiori — CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain).
  https://karsiori.itch.io/free-pixel-art-flower-pack
- Music and sound effects from Freesound (local filenames are listed below).
- Space weather data: NASA DONKI (Space Weather Database Of Notifications,
  Knowledge, Information), https://ccmc.gsfc.nasa.gov/tools/DONKI/
- Fonts (Fredoka, Nunito, IBM Plex Mono) are loaded from Google Fonts under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1; they are not included in this repository.
- npm dependencies (React, Vite, Zustand, TypeScript, ESLint and others) keep
  their own licenses.

